      "note": [
        "Items AFL63LS, D612, D614, D61SC, D619, D8, D81, D82, K5, K7 and AFL63LE in pansionschemes G and H are not classified in the core national accounts.",
        "The table include Swedish pension commitments relating to occupational pensions and the general pension scheme, but not voluntary individual pension agreements. The summary is part of the reporting to the European Union’s statistical agency, Eurostat. It is a special report where liabilities that are normally not included in the financial accounts are included. The purpose of the compilation is to facilitate comparisons between countries. Note that this recording for pensions is not entirely comparable to the corresponding information from Swedish insurance companies and authorities.",
        "2021-03-18: K5 9 “Changes in entitlements due to other changes in volume” and AFL63LE 10 “Pension entitlements (incl. contingent pension entitlements) December 31th” has been corrected in pensionscheme H “General government, Social security pension schemes” for 2018 and 2019."
      ],
